---
// Static mid-page conversion band. CTA anchors to the on-page #kontakt form.
---
<section class="cta-band" style="background: var(--blue); padding: 48px 0px;"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center"><p style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFC107;margin-bottom:14px;padding:6px 14px;background:rgba(255,193,7,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,193,7,.3);border-radius:999px"><span style="display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFC107;animation:pulse 2s infinite"></span>Nur noch wenige Termine diese Woche</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 8px">Bereit für deinen ersten Termin?</h2><p style="font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin:0 0 28px">Oft schon morgen verfügbar. Kostenlos und unverbindlich.</p><a href="#kontakt" class="btn-white" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:15px;padding:14px 32px">Termin anfragen</a></div></section>
